          {
            "title": "Multiple values",
            "id": 88373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le tuple sono utili perché ci permettono di restituire più valori da una funzione, come il punteggio più alto e quello più basso di un elenco.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione può restituire più valori sotto forma di tupla. Separali con una virgola.</p><p>Restituisci prima <code>highest_score</code>, poi <code>lowest_score</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"highest_score\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"max\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lowest_score\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"min\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"highest_score\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"lowest_score, highest_score\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Return a tuple",
            "id": 88377,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per restituire una tupla, scriviamo i valori che vogliamo restituire separati da una virgola <code>,</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"126\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "No parentheses",
            "id": 88378,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anche se stiamo restituendo una tupla, le parentesi non sono necessarie.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando restituiamo più valori, li separiamo con una virgola e non servono le parentesi.</p><p>Restituisci prima <code>highest_score</code>, poi <code>lowest_score</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores_list\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>highest_score</code>, <code>,</code> e infine <code>lowest_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store return value",
            "id": 88379,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per memorizzare una tupla restituita da una funzione, assegniamo il risultato della chiamata alla funzione a una variabile come <code>data</code>, come di consueto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"162\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"(80, 17)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>data</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per memorizzare una tupla restituita, assegna il risultato della chiamata di funzione a una variabile.</p><p>Memorizza la tupla in <code>data</code> affinché il codice stampi <code>(80, 17)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"162\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"169\" endIndex=\"184\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"(80, 17)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>data</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>get_scores_data</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Retrieve individual values",
            "id": 88380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo quindi recuperare i singoli valori tramite i relativi indici, ad esempio il punteggio più alto con <code>data[0]</code> e quello più basso con <code>data[1]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest = data[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"smallest = data[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;smallest score: \" /><text value=\"{smallest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;highest score: \" /><text value=\"{highest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"193\" endIndex=\"200\" /><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"229\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"smallest score: 17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest score: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>highest</code>, seguito da <code>data[1]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il punteggio più basso si trova all'indice <code>1</code> della tupla restituita. Memorizzalo in <code>smallest</code>, così il codice stampa <code>smallest score: 17</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest = data[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"smallest = data[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;smallest score: \" /><text value=\"{smallest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;highest score: \" /><text value=\"{highest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"219\" /><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"229\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data[0]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"smallest score: 17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest score: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>smallest</code>, seguito da <code>data[1]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "When to return a tuple",
            "id": 88381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poiché le tuple sono immutabili, restituiamo una tupla quando non avremo bisogno di modificarla, ma useremo semplicemente i valori, come nel caso dei vincitori di una partita.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_top_three\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"top_three = get_top_three(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;First: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Second: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Third: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First: Sue\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second: Ed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third: Ann\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>players[0], players[1], players[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poiché le tuple sono immutabili, restituisci una tupla quando devi solo usarne i valori, non modificarli.</p><p>Restituisci i primi tre giocatori in ordine affinché il codice stampi <code>First: Sue</code>, poi Ed e infine Ann.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_top_three\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"top_three = get_top_three(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;First: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Second: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Third: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players[1], players[0], players[2]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First: Sue\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second: Ed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third: Ann\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>players[0], players[1], players[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "When to return a list",
            "id": 88382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando vogliamo poter modificare la raccolta di valori restituita, ad esempio aggiornando un membro del team, restituiamo una lista come <code>team</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"form_team\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team.append(players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team.append(players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team = form_team(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chloe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(team)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"101\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Chloe', 'Ann']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>return team</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple values",
            "id": 88670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è uno degli usi principali delle tuple?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Restituire più valori all'interno delle funzioni</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Visualizzazione dei valori</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Restituire più valori all'interno delle funzioni.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uno degli usi principali delle tuple è restituire più valori da una funzione.</p><p>Una funzione calcola sia <code>width</code> sia <code>height</code>. Quale istruzione restituisce insieme entrambi i risultati?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return width, height</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(width, height)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return width</code> seguito da <code>return height</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return width, height</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return a tuple",
            "id": 88671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come separiamo i diversi valori quando restituiamo più valori da una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Utilizzando le virgole <code>,</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Utilizzo dei punti e virgola <code>;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Utilizzando le virgole <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Separiamo con virgole i diversi valori restituiti.</p><p>Quale riga restituisce correttamente <code>lowest</code> e <code>highest</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return lowest, highest</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return lowest; highest</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return lowest highest</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return lowest, highest</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No parentheses",
            "id": 88672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Servono le parentesi quando si restituiscono più valori?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, solo la parola chiave <code>return</code> seguita dai valori</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sì, intorno a ogni singolo valore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, solo la parola chiave <code>return</code> seguita dai valori.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per restituire più valori non servono parentesi, ma soltanto <code>return</code> seguito dai valori.</p><p>Cosa restituisce al chiamante <code>return name, age</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una tupla contenente <code>name</code> e <code>age</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Soltanto <code>name</code>, perché <code>age</code> è fuori dalle parentesi</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un errore, perché ogni valore richiede le proprie parentesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una tupla contenente <code>name</code> e <code>age</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store return value",
            "id": 88673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo salvare una tupla restituita da una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Archiviandolo in una variabile, come qualsiasi altro valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo salvare le tuple restituite dalle funzioni</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Archiviandolo in una variabile, come qualsiasi altro valore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salviamo una tupla restituita da una funzione memorizzandola in una variabile, come qualsiasi altro valore.</p><p>Quale riga memorizza in <code>bounds</code> la tupla restituita da <code>get_bounds()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bounds = get_bounds()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bounds == get_bounds()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_bounds(bounds)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>bounds = get_bounds()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Retrieve individual values",
            "id": 88674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come recuperiamo i singoli valori dalla tupla restituita da una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">In base al loro indice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">In base al loro valore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">In base al loro indice.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Recuperiamo i singoli valori di una tupla restituita tramite il loro indice.</p><p>La variabile <code>profile</code> memorizza <code>(\"Mia\", 21)</code>. Quale espressione recupera l'età?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>profile[1]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>profile[21]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>profile.age</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>profile[1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: When to return a tuple",
            "id": 88675,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando dovremmo restituire una tupla?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando ci interessano solo i singoli valori o non intendiamo modificare la tupla</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando intendiamo sostituire i valori nella tupla</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando ci interessano solo i singoli valori o non intendiamo modificare la tupla.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dovremmo restituire una tupla quando ci servono valori singoli che non intendiamo modificare.</p><p>Una funzione restituisce <code>latitude</code> e <code>longitude</code> fisse di un luogo. Quale valore restituito è più adatto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una tupla contenente le due coordinate</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una lista pensata per sostituire in seguito una delle coordinate</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Una stringa che unisce le coordinate e nasconde i singoli valori</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una tupla contenente le due coordinate.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: When to return a list",
            "id": 88676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando dovremmo restituire una lista invece di una tupla?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quando ci interessano i valori come insieme e intendiamo modificare la lista</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quando la raccolta di valori restituita non dovrebbe essere modificata</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quando ci interessano i valori come insieme e intendiamo modificare la lista.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dovremmo restituire una lista quando ci servono i valori come raccolta e intendiamo modificarla.</p><p>Una funzione restituisce elementi del carrello che gli utenti possono aggiungere e rimuovere. Quale valore restituito è più adatto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una lista contenente gli elementi del carrello</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una tupla che deve rimanere invariata</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Soltanto il primo elemento del carrello anziché l'intera raccolta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una lista contenente gli elementi del carrello.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple values",
            "id": 88677,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Restituisci i valori <code>age</code> seguiti da <code>can_drive</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"check_age\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  can_drive = age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age, can_drive\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"67\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>age</code> e poi <code>,</code>, <code>can_drive</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Restituisci due valori come tupla: prima <code>age</code>, poi <code>can_drive</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"check_age\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  can_drive = age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age, can_drive\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>age</code>, <code>,</code> e infine <code>can_drive</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return a tuple",
            "id": 88678,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Restituisci <code>profit</code>, seguito da <code>after_taxes</code> e infine da <code>above_mean</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"analyze_profit\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(gains, expenses)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  profit = gains - expenses\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  after_taxes = \" /><text value=\"0.85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * profit\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  above_mean = profit &gt; \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" profit, after_taxes, above_mean\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"139\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"152\" /><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"164\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>profit</code>, seguito da <code>,</code> e poi <code>after_taxes</code>, <code>,</code>, <code>above_mean</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Restituisci tre valori in ordine: <code>profit</code>, poi <code>after_taxes</code>, infine <code>above_mean</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"analyze_profit\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(gains, expenses)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  profit = gains - expenses\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  after_taxes = \" /><text value=\"0.85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * profit\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  above_mean = profit &gt; \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" profit, after_taxes, above_mean\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"139\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"152\" /><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"gains\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"expenses\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>profit</code>, seguito da <code>,</code>, <code>after_taxes</code>, <code>,</code> e infine <code>above_mean</code>.</p></body></html>",
